{"nodes": [{"id": "sites_nesterp_nesterp_site", "label": "Site: nesterp - Syncflo internal ERPNext (Frappe v16)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_frappe_nesterp_mcp_connector", "label": "frappe-nesterp MCP connector (authenticates as Russell's day-to-day profile)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_erpnext_sbca_status_on_nesterp", "label": "erpnext_sbca on nesterp: installed, not switched on", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keystone infrastructure: do not disable, stop the scheduled jobs or uninstall without Russell's explicit go-ahead; the 11 jobs no-op only because no Company credentials are wired."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_doreen_9t9it", "label": "Doreen (9t9it partner, author of erpnext_sbca)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_workspace_config_presales", "label": "Workspace / desk configuration for the presales user (2026-05-07)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_nest_theme_v0_2_0_scope_cut", "label": "nest_theme v0.2.0 scope cut (toolbar widgets retired)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Density/font toolbar widgets failed because the v16 modern desk navbar intercepts mouse clicks above document-level capture listeners; scope cut to a single locked palette, tightened spacing and logo override."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_nest_theme_v0_3_0_palette_switcher", "label": "nest_theme v0.3.0 palette switcher (admin-only, realtime)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Re-introduced as colour variants only (no font/spacing); Nest Theme Settings is System Manager only so client desk users cannot change the palette."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_nest_theme_sage_inspired_palette", "label": "nest_theme v0.3.2 Sage-inspired palette", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Green-forward lookalike gives users crossing the erpnext_sbca Sage bridge a visual link; Sage brand green #00DC06 is accent only because it fails white-text contrast as a button colour; unofficial, with disclaimer."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_lead_activity_hub", "label": "Lead Activity Hub desk Page (/desk/lead-activity/<lead>)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_my_activities_page", "label": "My Activities desk Page (/desk/my-activities)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_nest_crm_tasks_v0_0_4_fix", "label": "nest_crm_tasks v0.0.3 -> v0.0.4 fix ($main mounted inside page.body)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both pages selected a class nothing created, so the empty jQuery collection made every .html()/.on() silently no-op; fixed by creating the container explicitly inside page.body."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_why_custom_page_not_client_script", "label": "Why a custom Page and not a Client Script (v16 listview)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bubble-phase and capture-phase click interceptors, listview formatters and listview button all failed on v16 modern desk; don't fight the listview, build a custom Page."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_custom_subscription", "label": "custom_subscription app (Business Subscription recurring billing)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "end_date is the stop mechanism, intentionally no fixed invoice-count cap; cron 0 7 * * * (site timezone) so invoice creation and the confirmation email happen together at 07:00 SAST."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_custom_subscription_scheduler_bugs_fixed", "label": "custom_subscription bugs fixed 2026-05-20 (stuck scheduler, before_save rewind, date step, wrong email attachment)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exact-match next_invoice_date == today left any missed day stuck forever; changed to <= today with per-subscription try/except and commit so one bad record cannot abort the run."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_business_subscription_doctype", "label": "Business Subscription DocType (BS-.####)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_day_to_day_profile_full_access_2026_05_25", "label": "Day-to-day profile granted full access + admin (2026-05-25)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single apply-to-all Account User Permission plus 19 blocked modules were the real cause of the long-documented 'MCP user cannot read Company/Account' symptom."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_clean_go_live_restart_new_company", "label": "Clean go-live restart: new company Syncflo Pty Ltd (2026-05-28)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After fighting the in-place wipe (GL-link guards, Transaction Deletion Record UX) pivoted to a new company and moved the 199 leads; customers/contacts are site-wide and came along."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_frappe_crm_prospects", "label": "Frappe CRM installed as 'Prospects' for the big-client pipeline (2026-10-12)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Frappe CRM for big long-cycle clients converted manually to ERPNext Projects; ERPNext CRM + nest_crm_tasks stays for quick product sign-ups; no bulk data copy."}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_shared_deals_kanban", "label": "Shared Deals Kanban (CRM View Settings with user='' serves every user)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_crm_deal_next_step_from_tasks", "label": "Server Scripts: CRM Deal - Next Step from Tasks (save/delete)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "sites/nesterp.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sites_nesterp_crm_deal_primary_contact_name", "label": "Server Script: CRM Deal - Primary